  "description": "As a new transfer in his second year of high school, Gu Do-Hun faces relentless bullying for no clear reason—but his eyes are set on only one person: his quiet classmate, Jeong Yu-Won. Yu-Won tries to keep his distance, but Do-Hun’s strange, unreadable pull draws him in until a sudden, devastating incident rips them apart. Years later, they reunite as team leader and subordinate. Yu-Won tries to keep things professional, but the past refuses to stay buried...and neither does Do-Hun’s gaze. Something about him feels familiar yet entirely different. Has he changed…or was he always like this?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
